  "id": "proximate-explanation",
  "term": "proximate explanation",
  "definition": "A proximate explanation is an account of a phenomenon in terms of the immediate underlying mechanisms that produce it. In this packet, it refers to identifying the exact molecular processes that promote tumor formation in order to explain Peto’s paradox.",
